[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0010","text":"────嗯，那朝这边来一张"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0020","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0030","text":"──好了，谢谢\n会和告知一起使用的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0040","text":"……真是好衣服啊\n说是万圣节的妖精呢────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0050","text":"────如果是这样的妖怪，\n感觉会做出温柔又让人打起精神的恶作剧呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0060","text":"……\n温柔……让人打起精神────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0070","text":"────呵呵……\n我能做到吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0080","text":"那样的……\n妖怪……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0090","text":"……哈哈\n会给我力量的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0100","text":"这件衣服一定也是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800100_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
